    "title": "Looking for Medical Officer at Symbiosis Hospital Asia Pacific Associates",
    "description": "Are you a skilled Medical Officer looking for your next big career move? Symbiosis Hospital Asia Pacific Associates in Chennai offers you the perfect platform to grow professionally and personally.\n\nAbout Symbiosis Hospital Asia Pacific Associates:\nSymbiosis Hospital Asia Pacific Associates is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Provide high-quality patient care and maintain patient records\n• Maintain sterile environments and follow infection control protocols\n• Participate in quality improvement initiatives and clinical audits\n• Diagnose and treat medical conditions following established protocols\n• Coordinate with multidisciplinary teams for comprehensive patient management\n• Respond to medical emergencies and provide immediate care\n• Adhere to NABH/JCI accreditation standards\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Arch / M.Arch from recognized institution\n• 12-20 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in BLS/ACLS\n• Proficiency in Medical Terminology\n• Proficiency in Health Informatics\n• Proficiency in CPT Codes\n• Proficiency in Diagnostic Skills\n• Proficiency in Wound Care\n• Proficiency in EMR/EHR\n• Proficiency in Telemedicine\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Salary Range: 35 LPA - 70 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Chennai, Tamil Nadu, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Symbiosis Hospital Asia Pacific Associates!",
